{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-4186463","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【活动】2016宝可梦日月E3","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一记录在E3现场直播《宝可梦太阳与月亮》的紧张准备，以及首次公开的皇家对战和新宝可梦。","date":"2016-06-15","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · New Pokémon Sun and Moon information @ E3","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · New Pokémon Sun and Moon information @ E3","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4186463.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160617121629id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4186463.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[{"name":"宝可梦 太阳·月亮","slug":"sun-moon"}],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ポケモン"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":409,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-4186463/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/001-c557333cec.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[1136,850],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一记录在E3现场直播《宝可梦太阳与月亮》的紧张准备，以及首次公开的皇家对战和新宝可梦。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/001-c557333cec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/001-c557333cec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">大家都看了吗？</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">宝可梦 太阳 &amp; 月亮</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">E3 Treehouse Live</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">……</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">上午7:45</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">E3展会现场</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">演出开始前</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n在任天堂展台前\n\nTreehouse Live舞台前\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/002-fe51a97d52.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/002-fe51a97d52.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n上午8:00\n\n\n给我化了妆（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n上午8:30\n\n调试耳机\n\n和麦克风\n\n<br>\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/003-5ad04aed13.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/003-5ad04aed13.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n演出前太紧张了，\n所以没怎么笑（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后终于\n\n上午9:00\n\n演出开始！\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n在NicoNico Live、\n\nTwitch等网站进行直播！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/004-5b1baf6e90.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/004-5b1baf6e90.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/005-5ebaee61b0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/005-5ebaee61b0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/006-2966137838.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/006-2966137838.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n我们之前从没像这样\n在直播中演示游戏实机画面，\n所以很紧张（笑）！\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n当然也不知道\n会遇到哪只宝可梦……（笑）\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n如果只遇到芭瓢虫，大家肯定会失望的……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n但是\n\n幸运的是，\n我们遇到了小笃儿！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/007-1457342a36.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/007-1457342a36.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"716\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还有猫鼬少！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/008-5e3fdf4b73.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/008-5e3fdf4b73.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"438\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n虽然直播中没有遇到，\n\n但在高草丛中也有机会遇到\n强颚鸡母虫！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/009-ea60977310.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/009-ea60977310.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"490\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还有！\n\n全新的对战形式：\n\n皇家对战！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/010-4fabe4c106.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/010-4fabe4c106.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/011-648ed0a36f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/011-648ed0a36f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"240\"></a></figure>\n\n令人兴奋的四人对战！\n也可以通过 Wi-Fi 游玩！\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n期待宝可梦 太阳 &amp; 月亮，\n以及在阿罗拉地区的冒险吧！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/001-c557333cec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/001-c557333cec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Did everyone watch it?</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Pokémon Sun &amp; Moon</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Treehouse Live @ E3</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">・・・</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">7:45 AM</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">On the E3 show floor</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">before the show</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nAt the Nintendo booth in front\n\nof the Treehouse Live set\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/002-fe51a97d52.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/002-fe51a97d52.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n8:00 AM\n\n\nThey put makeup on me (lol)\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n8:30 AM\n\nSetting up earphones\n\nand microphones\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/003-5ad04aed13.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/003-5ad04aed13.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\nNervous before the show so\nnot much of a smile (lol)\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nAnd finally\n\n9:00 AM\n\nThe show begins!\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nStreamed on NicoNico Live,\n\nTwitch and other sites!\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/004-5b1baf6e90.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/004-5b1baf6e90.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/005-5ebaee61b0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/005-5ebaee61b0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/006-2966137838.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/006-2966137838.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nWe've never demonstrated gameplay\n\non a livestream like this before,\nso I was nervous (lol)!\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nOf course we didn't know\nwhich Pokémon might appear... (lol)\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nIf we only got Ledyba, everyone would be disappointed...\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nBut\n\nWe luckily encountered a Pikipek!\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/007-1457342a36.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/007-1457342a36.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"716\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nAnd Yungoos!\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/008-5e3fdf4b73.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/008-5e3fdf4b73.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"438\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nIt didn't appear during the stream,\n\nbut there was a chance to encounter\nGrubbin in the tall grass, too!\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/009-ea60977310.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/009-ea60977310.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"490\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nAlso!\n\nAn all new type of battle:\n\nBattle Royal!\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/010-4fabe4c106.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/010-4fabe4c106.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/011-648ed0a36f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4186463/011-648ed0a36f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"240\"></a></figure>\n\nExciting 4-player battles!\nPlay over Wi-Fi, too!\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nGet excited for\nPokémon Sun &amp; Moon\nand your adventures\nin the Alola region!!\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nCiao!</div>"}}